   "tail": "check: ok \u2014 7 tables (0 synced), 13 operations, no problems, 2 notes, 2.6 ms\nnote: schema.q:94:69 \u2014 N_SPARSE_FILTER: posts by byRank: this unscoped `where` pins no index prefix; sparse matches can exhaust the row meter and return short `complete: false` pages\n  rewrite: pin a leading index key, or run `snapback4 init --recipe feeds --prefix feed` for Following (followed authors, own posts and reposts)\n  guide: feeds\n\nnote: schema.q:77:1 \u2014 N_WIDE_MERGE: query following: read cost grows with the number of related principals (up to 2048 lanes); a read past the 8,192 examined ceiling returns `complete: false`\n  rewrite: keep read-time merges for a bounded small number of related principals; for Following, `snapback4 init --recipe feeds --prefix feed`; measure with `snapback4 check --cost`; if a held query answers this read, delete the merge\n  guide: feeds\n\n7 mutations never predict: like (reads online-only table posts), post (writes online-only table posts), seedFollows (writes online-only table follows), seedLikes (reads online-only table posts), seedMembers (writes online-only table members), seedMessages (writes online-only table messages), seedPosts (writes online-only table posts); 2 mutations have insert arms that never predict: like (likes is online only), seedLikes (likes is online only) \u2014 snapback4 why <op>\n"
